orld/us/what-happened-to-green-cards-stapled-to-diplomas-attorney-reacts-to-proposal-of-100000-opt-fee/articleshow/132771420.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/what-happened-to-green-cards-stapled-to-diplomas-attorney-reacts-to-proposal-of-100000-opt-fee/articleshow/132771420.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-31T21:02:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132771439,imgsize-114242.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Not Morocco, please': The human stories behind Spain's migrant crisis - report]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132771091.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/not-morocco-please-the-human-stories-behind-spains-migrant-crisis-report/articleshow/132771091.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/not-morocco-please-the-human-stories-behind-spains-migrant-crisis-report/articleshow/132771091.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-31T20:43:09+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132771091,imgsize-1394490.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A Michigan woman owns 19 acres between two planned Toll Brothers communities]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132770064.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A woman from Michigan has initiated legal action against Toll Brothers concerning their wastewater management and access rights. Her property, undeveloped, is situated between two upcoming luxury housing estates. The lawsuit alleges that the developers have disregarded her property rights and neglected environmental regulations. She aims to reinstate her access easement and challenge the site plan approvals.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-michigan-woman-owns-19-acres-between-two-planned-toll-brothers-communities-she-is-suing-over-her-only-access-route-and-a-proposed-wastewater-discharge/articleshow/132770064.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-michigan-woman-owns-19-acres-between-two-planned-toll-brothers-communities-she-is-suing-over-her-only-access-route-and-a-proposed-wastewater-discharge/articleshow/132770064.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-31T20:17:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132770701,imgsize-1619100.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Paradise for spies' no more: Japan launches first centralised intelligence body since WWII]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132770383.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/paradise-for-spies-no-more-japan-launches-first-centralised-intelligence-body-since-wwii/articleshow/132770383.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/paradise-for-spies-no-more-japan-launches-first-centralised-intelligence-body-since-wwii/articleshow/132770383.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-31T20:03:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132770445,imgsize-33234.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 1924, Arctic charr from Lake Geneva were stocked into Lake Allos; a century later...]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132768545.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Introduced to Lake Allos in 1924, Arctic charr exhibit remarkable metabolic adaptations within just a century. These fish showcase rapid physiological changes, attributed mainly to their phenotypic plasticity, resulting in distinct body shapes. Notably, juveniles from Lake Allos consistently demonstrate elevated metabolic rates, even under controlled conditions. This research underscores the species' ability to swiftly adapt to their ever-changing environmental landscape.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/in-1924-arctic-charr-from-lake-geneva-were-stocked-into-lake-allos-a-century-later-their-descendants-showed-distinct-metabolic-responses-under-identical-conditions/articleshow/132768545.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/in-1924-arctic-charr-from-lake-geneva-were-stocked-into-lake-allos-a-century-later-their-descendants-showed-distinct-metabolic-responses-under-identical-conditions/articleshow/132768545.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-31T19:41:37+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132770008,imgsize-1469238.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Travel alert for visa holders in US: Immigration experts say domestic flying has become risky, alarming rise in number of airport arrests]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132769459.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/travel-alert-for-visa-holders-in-us-immigration-experts-say-domestic-flying-has-become-risky/articleshow/132769459.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/travel-alert-for-